WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.299
All doctors are graduates.

2
00:00:02.299 --> 00:00:04.399
Some graduates are singers.

3
00:00:04.399 --> 00:00:06.434
So, are some doctors singers?

4
00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:08.284
Not necessarily.

5
00:00:08.662 --> 00:00:10.420
Draw a circle for graduates,

6
00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:12.091
with doctors inside it.

7
00:00:12.091 --> 00:00:13.506
The singers can sit in

8
00:00:13.506 --> 00:00:15.032
the part of the graduate

9
00:00:15.032 --> 00:00:17.232
circle that has no doctors.

10
00:00:17.919 --> 00:00:19.112
If all A are B,

11
00:00:19.112 --> 00:00:20.364
and all B are C,

12
00:00:20.364 --> 00:00:21.867
then all A are C.

13
00:00:21.867 --> 00:00:23.097
And if some A are

14
00:00:23.097 --> 00:00:24.477
B, then some B are

15
00:00:24.477 --> 00:00:27.194
A. That one always reverses.

16
00:00:27.546 --> 00:00:29.048
Try to build one picture

17
00:00:29.048 --> 00:00:30.971
where the conclusion fails.

18
00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:31.796
If you can,

19
00:00:31.796 --> 00:00:34.205
the conclusion does not follow.

20
00:00:34.888 --> 00:00:36.114
Your turn.

21
00:00:36.114 --> 00:00:38.365
Which conclusion follows?
